      "1": "Alignment Collapse: faces flicker random light and dark, hum broken and irregular, edges normal",
      "2": "Drift Escalation: light slides or drifts across faces, edges blurred and smearing, hum wavers in pitch",
      "3": "Echo Saturation: too bright and hard to look at, layered hum tones, frozen face patterns",
      "4": "Leak Instability: corners dim, edges fading, face perimeters dim while center is fine, hum hollow at edges",
      "5": "Low Intensity: dim all over, hum whisper, patterns washed out",
      "6": "High Intensity: all faces blazing white, loud harsh buzz, surface vibrates, heat from faces",
      "7": "Phase Inversion: opposite faces pulse bright and dark in rhythm, hum alternates two tones, edges flash in sync",
      "8": "Resonance Cascade: one face much brighter, high-pitched whine near it, other faces normal",
      "9": "Corner Deadlock: one or two corners glow bright, clicking or ticking sound, heat at those corners",
      "10": "Boundary Softening: edges wobble when touched, faces look curved and bulging, hum muffled and underwater",
      "11": "Propagation Stall: patterns frozen and dim and still, hum silent, surface cold, no response to touch",
      "12": "Harmonic Split: hum split into clashing tones, patterns alternate two configurations, edges shimmer",
      "13": "Thermal Bleed: very hot and dim, low rumble hum, surfaces rough and gritty, reddish light",
      "14": "Core Void: faces glow normally, sounds hollow when tapped, dark center with no light penetration, thin surface hum",
